        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Textile panel of satin damask with a large scale bizarre design in green, yellow and pink silk and silver threads filé and frisé. An exotic flower is growing from a silver tub in one part of the textile and in another is a rose growing from a silver vase. Much of the design is missing as the fragments are long and have narrow stripe."@en ;
